{
  "key": 54704,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0692_00000",
      "en_US": "Doug"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0692_00001",
      "en_US": [
        "We should trade phone numbers, so I\n",
        "can educate you more on the\f",
        "merits of Bug-type Pokémon!{YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0692_00002",
      "en_US": [
        "You betcha. Thanks!\n",
        "I’ll call you sometime!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0692_00003",
      "en_US": "Don’t say such sad things..."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0692_00004",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh, did you decide to exchange\n",
        "phone numbers after all? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0692_00005",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh, there you are!\r",
        "I thought I’d give you a Berry, so I’ve\n",
        "been waiting here for you!\r",
        "Here you go!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0692_00006",
      "en_US": [
        "Wait, what?\r",
        "If you’re nearby, don’t bother with the\n",
        "phone. Come talk in person!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0692_00007",
      "en_US": [
        "My {STRVAR_1 0, 10, 0} is growing up well,\n",
        "if I do say so myself!\r",
        "Why, in a recent battle against\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 0, 11, 0}, it knocked it out before\f",
        "I could blink!\r",
        "Before I could even blink! Amazing, eh?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0692_00008",
      "en_US": [
        "Argh, I give up! My {STRVAR_1 0, 10, 0} has\n",
        "gotten pretty strong, you know.\r",
        "I figured that it should be able to\n",
        "easily knock out a {STRVAR_1 0, 11, 0}...\r",
        "But once we got a good look at it, we\n",
        "saw it was really high level...\f",
        "We got beaten up, down, and sideways..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0692_00009",
      "en_US": [
        "You know, earlier by the roadside, this\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 0, 11, 0} jumped out at me!\r",
        "I really love Pokémon, but...bam!\n",
        "It sure startled me!\r",
        "I mean, if you’re going to jump out at a\n",
        "person, you should at least have the\f",
        "decency to introduce yourself first!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0692_00010",
      "en_US": [
        "You know, I’d really like to sit down and\n",
        "talk with you about the virtues of\f",
        "Bug-type Pokémon!\r",
        "What do you think? I’m on\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 4, 3, 0}. How about you come\f",
        "over for a battle?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0692_00011",
      "en_US": [
        "Let’s have a battle. We haven’t had one\n",
        "in a while! I’m on {STRVAR_1 4, 3, 0}...\f",
        "Don’t forget!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0692_00012",
      "en_US": [
        "You know, my dad was a researcher\n",
        "studying Bug-type Pokémon.\r",
        "Ever since I was young, there’s\n",
        "always been Bug-type Pokémon\f",
        "scattered all over the house.\r",
        "That’s why I started to like Bug-type\n",
        "Pokémon so much myself.\r",
        "My mom...\n",
        "Well, she screamed a lot."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0692_00013",
      "en_US": [
        "I found some Berries. I’ve already got\n",
        "more than I need, so I’ll give you some!\r",
        "I’m on {STRVAR_1 4, 3, 0}. Come pick\n",
        "them up!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0692_00014",
      "en_US": [
        "You want Berries, don’t you?\r",
        "I’ll give you some if you come visit me\n",
        "on {STRVAR_1 4, 3, 0}!"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
